    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like we're waiting forever for her to feel better. if she's really low on iron, wouldn't her body just use what it needs? like if i give her a bit more, won't it just help her replenish those levels quicker? it feels like we're just stalling her recovery.",
